                "retweet_count": 24,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "While many people on Medicaid, especially the most vulnerable like people with disabilities, are losing benefits, many hospitals are profiteering off their backs. \n\n\u201c\u2026 the state and the \u2026 CMS decided to reimburse hospitals for their Medicaid services at the commercial payment rates. Most of the funding comes from federal taxpayers.\u201d \u201c\u2026 more than twice what Medicare would pay.\u201d\n\n\u201cFederal taxpayers are having their dollars funneled by the federal and state governments to hospitals \u2026 encouraging high commercial prices that hurt workers and employers in the state.\u201d\n\nhttps://t.co/gg2Os12a7Z",
